<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Academic Catalog</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 48pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <span style="color: #000080;">■</span> 2025-26 <span style="color: #000080;">■</span>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 30pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      ACADEMIC CATALOG
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: auto;">
      <!-- Placeholder for University Logo/Seal -->
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #ccc; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-size: 10pt;">
        [University Seal Placeholder]
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="university_location">{{ university_location }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold;">
      <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>
    </h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 10px;">
      Table of Contents
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div style="width: 100%; border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 5px 0;">
      <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
        Course...................................................................................................
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30px; text-align: right;">2</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 5px 0;">
      <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
        MTH 135 - Intermediate Algebra...................................................................
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30px; text-align: right;">2</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 30pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    Course
  </h1>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 22pt; font-weight: bold;">
      MTH 135 - Intermediate Algebra
    </h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">
      This course develops essential mathematics skills for problem-solving and prepares students for their general education mathematics requirement. Students apply logical reasoning and quantitative methods to analyze and calculate numerical relationships, solve equations and inequalities, and interpret mathematical models. Minimum grade of C required for successful completion. The course counts as an elective for graduation and may not be used to meet specific program requirements. Suitable test score, ACT Math score of 18 (minimum) or a SAT Math score of 430.
    </p>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">
      Upon completion, students will be able to:
    </p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.6;">
      <li>Apply logical reasoning and quantitative methods to analyze and solve problems involving numerical relationships</li>
      <li>Develop and implement strategies to solve equations, inequalities, and other mathematical models</li>
      <li>Interpret and represent mathematical relationships visually, symbolically, and graphically</li>
      <li>Evaluate patterns, structures, and relationships to simplify expressions and manipulate algebraic forms</li>
      <li>Use appropriate problem-solving techniques to explore and evaluate multiple approaches when working with mathematical situations</li>
      <li>Communicate mathematical reasoning effectively using accurate terminology, representations, and notation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Grade Basis:</p>
      <p><span data-field="grade_basis">{{ grade_basis }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Credit hours:</p>
      <p><span data-field="credit_hours">{{ credit_hours }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Lecture hours:</p>
      <p><span data-field="lecture_hours">{{ lecture_hours }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Lab hours:</p>
      <p><span data-field="lab_hours">{{ lab_hours }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Prerequisites:</p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.6;">
      <li><span data-field="prerequisite_course_code">{{ prerequisite_course_code }}</span> - Foundations of Mathematics</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">
      Last updated: <span data-field="last_updated_date">{{ last_updated_date }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">
      <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">
      <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>
      <span data-field="street_address">{{ street_address }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>